# The `aipl` beside this file is the compiler that builds this project
# (DESIGN_PRINCIPLES.md §4). This records which compiler it is: a
# fingerprint of every file the binary was built from.
#
# It exists because the projects in *this* repository are held to the
# current compiler — a project of your own would not have one. Checked by
# `projects::checked_in_compilers_are_current`; rewritten, with the
# binary, by `cargo handoff`.
